    "detailed_description": "You wake up one day feeling a sharp pain through your chest. All of a sudden, your senses start to betray you. Your innards feel as if they were on fire, girls appear cuter the more you look at them: you have been cursed! Delve into the dark depths of the rainforest and find the crypt from which your enchantment came!<br><br>Catlike Magic is a top-down auto-shooter bullet hell game where you play as a tiny cat mage trying to rid herself of a curse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Various magic powers to hurt your enemies with.<br></li><li>    Special modifiers that significantly improve or change the function of your abilities.<br></li><li>    Goblins that send you flying across the screen.<br></li><li>    30+ unique items that increase your stats and give you special effects.<br></li><li>    4 different playable characters, from tiny cats to bigger cats to goblins.  </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You wake up one day feeling a sharp pain through your chest. All of a sudden, your senses start to betray you. Your innards feel as if they were on fire, girls appear cuter the more you look at them: you have been cursed! Delve into the dark depths of the rainforest and find the crypt from which your enchantment came!<br><br>Catlike Magic is a top-down auto-shooter bullet hell game where you play as a tiny cat mage trying to rid herself of a curse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Various magic powers to hurt your enemies with.<br></li><li>    Special modifiers that significantly improve or change the function of your abilities.<br></li><li>    Goblins that send you flying across the screen.<br></li><li>    30+ unique items that increase your stats and give you special effects.<br></li><li>    4 different playable characters, from tiny cats to bigger cats to goblins.  </li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Catlike Magic is a top-down auto-shooter where you attempt to dodge groups of gnomes, goblins and other types of short people. Learn magical skills, buy and upgrade items and then complain about getting destroyed by a swarm of lizards after only buying offensive items in this slightly unhinged game.",
